{
  "name": "AI Job Agent / 01 Job Ingestion",
  "active": false,
  "description": "Manual trigger, dryRun-default job ingestion. n8n owns provider HTTP fetch/retry/rate-limiting for sources discovered dynamically from company_sources (Phase 12); TypeScript owns validation, dedup, persistence via one internal endpoint.",
